flowchart TD
  Menu["Customer taps interactive button: Request a room"]
  Check["Eligibility: supported client, approved hotel and template/session"]
  Flow["Optional Meta WhatsApp Flows in-chat form"]
  Fields["Structured dates, guest count, enquiry contact and consent"]
  Data{"Encrypted data exchange integration approved and deployed?"}
  Dynamic["Server endpoint validates flow token, decrypts payload securely, tenant scopes"]
  Static["Use static screens or ordinary chat, no fake live availability"]
  Verify["Validate capacity/availability ONLY against hotel PMS when authorized"]
  Fallback["If no PMS: create enquiry and staff case, not booking"]
  Submit["Commit request id, audit and outbound status"]
  Return["WhatsApp flow completion receipt and human escalation option"]
  Menu --> Check --> Flow --> Fields --> Data
  Data -->|"Yes"| Dynamic --> Verify
  Data -->|"No"| Static --> Fallback
  Verify -->|"Unavailable/unknown"| Fallback --> Submit
  Verify -->|"Source verified"| Submit --> Return
  Submit --> Return
